      "premise": "A lonely collector dies, leaving behind a staggering fortune. Following the terms of the will, his relatives gather at Silverwing Manor, a house perched on a precipice, only to find themselves trapped within its bizarre architecture. Night after night, the sound of flapping wings echoes from behind the walls, and inexplicable deaths occur within locked rooms. As the season of migration arrives, the manor transforms into a cursed abyss. Are these truly paranormal occurrences, or a meticulously calculated labyrinth of madness?"
